All create and edit modals: removed outer ScrollView so content is never clipped on small iPhones; KeyboardAvoidingView drives height instead. Title inputs use large Georgia font (journal-style). Date and time fields replaced with inline chip/toggle pattern — tap expands a native picker inline rather than a dedicated picker row. Affected: CreateIdeaModal, CreateGoalModal, CreateProjectModal, CreateTaskModal, CreateEventModal, EditEventModal, EditTaskModal. DatePicker gained a compact prop for inline use.
